#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:49
#: ddef4cbc8d86421da113c2f13af003bc
msgid ""
"See the individual :ref:`autopilot's<common-autopilots>`  description page "
"for what specific ports are provided and the exact pinouts of each port."
msgstr "各飞控提供的具体端口和引脚定义请参阅各自的 :ref:`飞控<common-autopilots>` 说明页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:51
#: 71f31182b2c14cf7bf1c3e6bb062d389
msgid ""
"For detailed guidance on cable design, signal routing, and color coding "
"schemes, especially for larger vehicles with longer wiring runs, see "
":ref:`Cable Design Guidelines <common-cabling-guide>`."
msgstr ""
"有关线缆设计、信号走线和颜色编码方案的详细指导（尤其是走线较长的大型飞行器），请参阅 :ref:`线缆设计指南 <common-cabling-"
"guide>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:55
#: ccecd1b32ef14b0894c5602bda7418fc
msgid "USB"
msgstr "USB"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:57
#: 0622ca8d512e4b6e8e7e21629aa0ea17
msgid ""
"USB is provided as the primary port for the autopilot configuration. It "
"always appears as the first serial port (SERIAL0) on the autopilot. See "
":ref:`Serial Port Configuration <common-serial-options>`"
msgstr ""
"USB 作为飞控配置的主要端口提供，始终显示为飞控的第一个串口（SERIAL0）。参见 :ref:`串口配置 <common-serial-"
"options>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:60
#: ce05f1968ec64f14a663719b80016622
msgid "UART"
msgstr "UART"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:62
#: 1da9538cba3249bd92321919e5c01163
msgid ""
"Usually, several UART ports are provided. These provide connections to "
"Telemetry radios, GPS, Rangefinders, and even SBUS servos. In addition, as "
"of firmware version 4.0, serial RC receiver inputs can be connected to any "
"UART. See :ref:`Serial Port Configuration <common-serial-options>`"
msgstr ""
"通常提供多个 UART 端口，用于连接数传电台、GPS、测距仪，甚至 SBUS 舵机。此外，从固件版本 4.0 起，串行 RC 接收机输入可以连接到任何"
" UART。参见 :ref:`串口配置 <common-serial-options>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:65
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:83
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:98
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:118
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:158
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:171
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:186
#: 082e9db79ab14b32969b153115a4d84c 0a560e593b834ca2a4d855d3f202de6c
#: 110e40ddb62e42a9bbe8143e12a99920 409274e26240452cab12bfc45a09130b
#: 71f6108f209a40b4916975bbfc097e49 b780bee8097548a0b5605fb95df47d12
#: df83f54009e94fdcac94d7d7e1e74a2f
msgid "Signals"
msgstr "信号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:67
#: 916d5152e2134c33add65fb05fc036e6
msgid "TX: Data Output, connects to peripherals RX signal"
msgstr "TX：数据输出，连接到外设的 RX 信号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:68
#: 1dedb49ae94e4d8280e978abe1f3524b
msgid "RX: Data Input, connect to peripheral TX signal"
msgstr "RX：数据输入，连接到外设的 TX 信号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:70
#: bdb62ada22024a19ab938b05272d85bb
msgid ""
"Usually, +5V and GND are provided in the connector, or close by if a board-"
"style autopilot"
msgstr "通常，连接器中提供 +5V 和 GND，或对于板卡式飞控在附近提供"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:72
#: 8235e5ca74b7484db5d1c82235562fdb
msgid ""
"Sometimes flow control signals are optionally provided in the connector. "
"Some Telemetry radios utilize these signals:"
msgstr "有时连接器中可选提供流控信号。某些数传电台使用这些信号："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:74
#: 4d2b9a95a27b451cb0113d307903dae7
msgid "CTS: Clear to Send Output to peripheral's labeled CTS input"
msgstr "CTS：发送允许输出，连接到外设标记的 CTS 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:75
#: 9c71e685547e47f588397b661bd02ffc
msgid "RTS: Request to Send Input from peripheral's labeled RTS output"
msgstr "RTS：发送请求输入，来自外设标记的 RTS 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:78
#: 8507f3a3b2994b24a69a9144611b3b5d
msgid "I2C"
msgstr "I2C"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:80
#: 4c6030a05cdd48f9ba66a827a6ead8a1
msgid ""
"I2C is used to connect certain sensors or peripherals. Most notably "
"compasses (which are mandatory in many vehicles) and digital airspeed "
"sensors."
msgstr "I2C 用于连接某些传感器或外设，最常见的是罗盘（在许多飞行器中为必需项）和数字空速传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:85
#: e6f50bf170c543a39369069e8c0646f3
msgid "SCL: Clock Output, connects to peripherals SCL pin"
msgstr "SCL：时钟输出，连接到外设的 SCL 引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:86
#: e20986f986ac49b1bc3a8b74fae8642b
msgid "SDA: Bi-directional Data, connects to peripherals SDA pin"
msgstr "SDA：双向数据，连接到外设的 SDA 引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:88
#: 8b7018786f94409bafb2d39f779ff5a4
msgid ""
"While I2C uses 3.3V signaling, often +5V is supplied in the connector along "
"with the signals, since many I2C devices actually use this as main power. If"
" not enough ports are provided, I2C expansion boards can allow more than one"
" device to be connected."
msgstr ""
"虽然 I2C 使用 3.3V 信号，但连接器中通常同时提供 +5V，因为许多 I2C 设备将其用作主电源。如果端口不够用，I2C "
"扩展板可以允许连接多个设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:90
#: 132f12ac83e24b46863e5276d38f2304
msgid ""
"Some board-level autopilots require external 2K ohm pullups on the signal "
"lines to 3.3V since they are not provided on the board, while some I2C "
"peripherals provide the pull-ups. If the device does not operate properly, "
"one should first be sure that the pull-ups are provided somewhere."
msgstr ""
"某些板卡级飞控要求在信号线上外接 2K 欧姆上拉电阻到 3.3V（因为板卡上未提供），而某些 I2C "
"外设自带上拉电阻。如果设备工作不正常，应首先确认上拉电阻是否已在某处提供。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:93
#: 2c283647388c41789bd3b2765753d8cf
msgid "GPS"
msgstr "GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:95
#: 46a23e5b23124c97909e7ff745deb75e
msgid ""
":ref:`GPS<common-positioning-landing-page>` is usually attached to one of "
"the UART ports, but some autopilots provide a connector dedicated to GPS "
"and/or GPS/Compass which includes the I2C signals."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GPS<common-positioning-landing-page>` 通常连接到某个 UART 端口，但部分飞控提供专用的 GPS "
"和/或 GPS/罗盘连接器，其中包含 I2C 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:100
#: 86b50927b2ea4b4fa94e340e5aa3cf3d
msgid "TX: Data Output, connected to the GPS RX input"
msgstr "TX：数据输出，连接到 GPS 的 RX 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:101
#: c89f54fce2ef4716ac4358c55878a121
msgid "RX: Data Input, connected to the GPS TX output"
msgstr "RX：数据输入，连接到 GPS 的 TX 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:103
#: 712a5dbc1fdd4d65b266144b39a6d578
msgid "Note the swapping of signals between autopilot and peripheral."
msgstr "注意飞控与外设之间信号的交叉连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:105
#: 6cc47c8a2b944478b5f456751981ce88
msgid ""
"usually +5V and GND are provided in the connector. If it is a GPS/Compass "
"port, then the I2C signals will also be provided and attached to the same "
"named signals on the compass sub-module of a GPS/Compass module."
msgstr "连接器中通常提供 +5V 和 GND。如果是 GPS/罗盘端口，则还会提供 I2C 信号，连接到 GPS/罗盘模块内罗盘子模块的同名信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:109
#: 0cadb3abbed24cf59db8a012b55f18cf
msgid "PMU"
msgstr "PMU"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:111
#: c108b571cef245128f9b5f319c64869c
msgid ""
"Most autopilots provide the means to attach to a Power Management Unit (PMU)"
" of some kind. These :ref:`units<common-powermodule-landingpage>` provide "
"any, or all, of the following:"
msgstr ""
"大多数飞控提供连接某种电源管理单元（PMU）的手段。这些 :ref:`单元<common-powermodule-landingpage>` "
"提供以下任一或全部功能："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:113
#: e7fc70f2ca79466898b300eca174a6b5
msgid "A regulated +5V supply for the autopilot from the flight battery"
msgstr "从飞行电池为飞控提供稳压 +5V 电源"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:114
#: c484ee07fe6a4c2eb972b53d4f18fd3a
msgid "Monitoring of current from the flight battery"
msgstr "监测飞行电池的电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:115
#: e790f1c7403c45d7a41e9067370da85f
msgid "Monitoring of voltage from the flight battery"
msgstr "监测飞行电池的电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:120
#: 8d7568c6c2d74370974d369e7db15835
msgid "+5V: Regulated supply to autopilot"
msgstr "+5V：飞控稳压供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:121
#: 713ca6eada6c4bcb85f93a31a59824b0
msgid ""
"CUR: Current Monitor output. Usually, a 0-3.3v analog voltage represents the"
" current draw level"
msgstr "CUR：电流监测输出。通常以 0-3.3V 模拟电压表示电流大小"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:122
#: d28d9b0d2b924c07b4f48e7d534ba160
msgid ""
"VLT: Voltage Monitor output. Usually, a  0-3.3V analog voltage representing "
"battery voltage"
msgstr "VLT：电压监测输出。通常以 0-3.3V 模拟电压表示电池电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:123
#: a758e01ba1c140609cdc6e9f39a84e87
msgid "GND: Ground"
msgstr "GND：地"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:125
#: beafb3f730d944189c20349cc4512a7e
msgid ""
"Some \"smart\" battery/power monitors replace the CUR and VLT pins with I2C "
"signals to provide digital information on battery status."
msgstr "某些「智能」电池/电源监视器用I2C信号替代CUR和VLT引脚，以数字方式提供电池状态信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:127
#: 35476a36502242c68d4f1573822e6172
msgid ""
"Many board-style autopilots fully integrate the PMU as part of the board "
"with internal connections to the processor."
msgstr "许多板载式飞控将PMU完全集成在板上，通过内部连接与处理器相连。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:129
#: 7e8ecfde620743768279f37c9391e727
msgid ""
"In addition, many autopilots offer multiple PMU connections since ArduPilot "
"firmware versions 4.0 and later support up to 10 PMUs/Battery Monitors."
msgstr "此外，由于ArduPilot固件4.0及更高版本支持最多10个PMU/电池监视器，许多飞控提供多个PMU连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:132
#: 97ef8d7cc56f42468796b43d0200ff2f
msgid "RCIN"
msgstr "RCIN"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:134
#: 45ed0be7a204479e9b3da165c4f6f8af
msgid ""
"Input from the radio control receiver is input on this pin. Most serial RC "
"protocols (PPM, SBUS, DSM, etc.) are supported by ArduPilot and auto-"
"detected. In addition, some autopilots provide dedicated connectors for DSM "
"protocol satellite receivers which provide power to the receiver in addition"
" to the input signal."
msgstr ""
"遥控接收机的输入信号通过此引脚接入。ArduPilot支持大多数串行遥控协议（PPM、SBUS、DSM等）并自动检测。此外，部分飞控为DSM协议卫星接收机提供专用连接器，除输入信号外还为接收机供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:136
#: 2dfb6d6811b74bfe810b108b7625b493
msgid ""
"As of firmware versions 4.0 and later, ArduPilot also allows an RC receiver "
"to be attached to any UART port."
msgstr "从固件4.0版本起，ArduPilot还允许将遥控接收机连接到任意UART端口，而不局限于专用的RCin或SBUS输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:139
#: 27b47ce406f343e4b22720aa2d1045d3
msgid "MAIN/AUX/OUT"
msgstr "MAIN/AUX/OUT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:141
#: a34a42f55ef140c4b87f5e31fce4923c
msgid ""
"The primary outputs for controlling motors (via ESCs) and servos are "
"provided by these pins/connectors. They are labeled either as MAIN/AUX "
"outputs or just as OUTPUTs. These outputs provide the PWM or Dshot signals "
"for motor ESC or servo control of flight surfaces. They can also be "
"sometimes used as general purpose I/O pins for controlling relays, "
"parachutes, grippers, etc."
msgstr ""
"这些引脚/连接器提供控制电机（通过ESC）和舵机的主要输出。它们标注为MAIN/AUX输出或仅标注为OUTPUT。这些输出为电机ESC或舵机提供PWM或DShot信号。有时也可用作通用I/O引脚，控制继电器、降落伞、机械爪等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:143
#: 37825722c3a34da3bf16758adce87806
msgid ""
"Those controllers with MAIN/AUX output labels usually indicate that a IOMCU "
"co-processor is being employed. These provide outputs intended for use as "
"the motor/servo outputs and provide a redundant means of control via RC if "
"the main autopilot fails. The MAIN outputs come from this co-processor, "
"while the AUX designated outputs are controlled directly from the autopilot."
" Most board level autopilots do not use an IOMCU and have outputs only "
"labeled OUTPUTx or Mx."
msgstr ""
"带有MAIN/AUX输出标签的飞控通常表明使用了IOMCU协处理器。这些输出用于电机/舵机控制，并在主飞控失效时通过遥控提供冗余控制手段。MAIN输出来自协处理器，而AUX输出由飞控直接控制。大多数板级飞控不使用IOMCU，其输出仅标注为OUTPUTx或Mx。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:145
#: d923d15b04464488958a42bfbd4b1dd5
msgid ""
"This distinction is important since AUX outputs(and OUTPUTs from autopilots "
"without an IOMCU) can be used as GPIOs as well as PWM or Dshot. While MAIN "
"outputs can only be used for PWM, except for use as RELAY GPIOs. See "
":ref:`GPIOs <common-gpios>`"
msgstr ""
"这一区别很重要，因为AUX输出（以及无IOMCU飞控的OUTPUT）可用作GPIO，也可用作PWM或DShot。而MAIN输出只能用于PWM，但可用作RELAY"
" GPIO。参见 :ref:`GPIO <common-gpios>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:147
#: d660b609c95043bdb8e18784fbfc9b99
msgid ""
"A few autopilots that do NOT use an IOMCU label their outputs as MAIN, so "
"actually do have the capability of use as GPIOs and/or Dshot ESC control on "
"these outputs. CUAV V5 Nano and Holybro Pixhawk 4 Mini are examples."
msgstr ""
"少数不使用IOMCU的飞控将其输出标注为MAIN，实际上这些输出具备GPIO和/或DShot ESC控制能力。CUAV V5 Nano和Holybro "
"Pixhawk 4 Mini就是典型例子。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:149
#: dc554d952cce4a5caa028070bc52646a
msgid ""
"Often these outputs are provided on 3-pin connector strips supplying or "
"distributing servo power and ground, in addition to the individual output "
"signals. This power is usually provided externally, such as by the ESC or a "
"BEC, although some autopilots provide this power from internal regulators."
msgstr ""
"这些输出通常通过3针连接器排提供，分配舵机电源和地线，并提供各自的输出信号。电源通常由外部供给，例如由ESC或BEC提供，但部分飞控通过内部稳压器供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:152
#: c4f0cb79b4a54daa81727258b210ae9f
msgid "CAN"
msgstr "CAN"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:154
#: 2a5b8f8831eb4478895d37b4710909c5
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN <common-canbus-setup-advanced>` bus is provided on many autopilots"
" for use with :ref:`DroneCAN <common-uavcan-setup-advanced>` peripherals. "
"ESCs, GPS/Compass, Rangefinders, and many other peripherals and sensors are "
"being added to the list of available DroneCAN devices every day. CAN "
"provides a robust method of communicating with peripherals with data "
"integrity, even with long leads."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN <common-canbus-setup-advanced>` 总线在许多飞控上可用，用于连接 :ref:`DroneCAN "
"<common-uavcan-setup-advanced>` "
"外设。ESC、GPS/罗盘、测距仪以及许多其他外设和传感器正不断加入DroneCAN设备列表。CAN即使在导线较长的情况下也能以数据完整性保障与外设可靠通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:160
#: d000e7e296f8415ca7f4a4917d0f927b
msgid "CAN_H: CAN high side signal, connects to peripherals CAN_H pin"
msgstr "CAN_H：CAN高侧信号，连接外设的CAN_H引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:161
#: 5dcb05cbb3da45c3958843503c2b8683
msgid "CAN_L: CAN low side signal, connects to peripherals CAN_L pin"
msgstr "CAN_L：CAN低侧信号，连接外设的CAN_L引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:163
#: 32cdbfd7dfaf426db9496dc5f2a4992f
msgid ""
"Power and ground are usually also provided on a standard 4-pin JST-GH "
"connector."
msgstr "电源和地线通常也通过标准4针JST-GH连接器提供。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:166
#: 73ebaefdd27b4877a28f5d23636fcd5e
msgid "SPI"
msgstr "SPI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:168
#: 673a1adb196c4fa9b3f8952a0ef61e92
msgid ""
"Most autopilots have processors with multiple SPI ports. While some ports "
"are used for onboard peripherals, often one or more are provided externally "
"for the addition of sensor chips such as barometers or IMUs, for redundancy."
msgstr ""
"大多数飞控处理器具有多个SPI端口。部分端口用于板载外设，通常还对外提供一个或多个SPI端口，用于添加气压计或IMU等传感器芯片，以实现冗余。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:173
#: 525ff5f63d8a4df194223fae0b44859b
msgid "CSx:  One or more chip selects for enabling the SPI peripheral"
msgstr "CSx：一个或多个片选信号，用于使能SPI外设"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:174
#: daba78675bd545b99eb58df98d6dd64e
msgid ""
"MOSI: Master Out/Slave In Data, connects to the same signal on SPI "
"peripheral"
msgstr "MOSI：主出从入数据，连接SPI外设的同名信号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:175
#: b4426525d21d4fca9f390a3a896702e0
msgid ""
"MISO: Master In/Slave Out Data, connects to the same signal on SPI "
"peripheral"
msgstr "MISO：主入从出数据，连接SPI外设的同名信号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:176
#: c98655c9f42149b0a2708b340bd79392
msgid "SCK:  Clock Signal"
msgstr "SCK：时钟信号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:178
#: a054bef5cc5a43fb921977a4ed2687b8
msgid ""
"SPI signal names can be labeled in many different ways. See the `SPI "
"Wikipedia entry "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serial_Peripheral_Interface>`__ for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"SPI信号名称有多种标注方式。更多信息请参见 `SPI维基百科词条 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serial_Peripheral_Interface>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:181
#: e41147289c5746179dc374d4b172b2eb
msgid "SAFETY SW/LED"
msgstr "SAFETY SW/LED"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:183
#: c1a6ea99fbaa42229beb83516fe2b0d1
msgid ""
"Many autopilots provide dedicated GPIOs on a connector for adding the "
"optional safety switch and notification LEDs that ArduPilot supports. "
"Usually, these are offered on autopilots that utilize an IOMCU co-processor."
msgstr ""
"许多飞控在连接器上提供专用GPIO，用于连接ArduPilot支持的可选安全开关和通知LED。通常在使用IOMCU协处理器的飞控上提供此接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:188
#: a7df9b50188941d3aff497b7fb1b9315
msgid "+3.3V :  Supply to the LED and Switch"
msgstr "+3.3V：为LED和开关供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:189
#: 91bd025617db4382b91bb3c2fa70a3a7
msgid "LED:     Drives the ground side of the notification LED"
msgstr "LED：驱动通知LED的地侧"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:190
#: c4a8a5ad004b4bc3ae83743994d269ae
msgid "SW:      Senses if +3.3V is present to indicate switch closure"
msgstr "SW：检测+3.3V是否存在，以指示开关闭合"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:194
#: 3a7a78a1c6f9424ea572f2e539dbd285
msgid "BUZZER"
msgstr "BUZZER"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:196
#: 1518d712738842c49e991cbee47962cd
msgid ""
"A -BUZZ output is sometimes provided for a passive or active buzzer for "
"system notification sounds, and provides a switched ground connection to the"
" buzzer. See :ref:`Buzzer<common-buzzer>`"
msgstr ""
"有时提供-BUZZ输出，用于连接无源或有源蜂鸣器发出系统通知音，为蜂鸣器提供切换的地连接。参见 :ref:`蜂鸣器<common-buzzer>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:199
#: a03126bbe0414aeabce697a8d32fc961
msgid "ANALOG INPUTS"
msgstr "模拟输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:201
#: 74b14942cac84a9799f251684d1bcad5
msgid ""
"Often analog voltage measurement pins are provided. These are used for "
"current and/or voltage sensing from a power monitor (if a dedicated "
"connector has not been provided), other system voltage monitor points, or "
"for analog :ref:`RSSI<common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication>` "
"input."
msgstr ""
"通常提供模拟电压测量引脚。这些引脚用于来自电源监视器的电流和/或电压检测（如果未提供专用连接器）、其他系统电压监测点，或模拟 "
":ref:`RSSI<common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication>` 输入。"
